    "id": "cbdad4db-78b1-402b-ad69-038866c95c16",
    "title": "",
    "body": "Hi Christian and Carmen,\n\nThank you so much for the offer and for all the time and care the team put into the process. It was so nice to meet you guys on during the interview \u2014 it really was one of the warmest interviews I had ever had! I am genuinely excited about the work and the chance to collaborate with the team, which made this a very difficult decision.\n\nAfter a lot of thought, I\u2019ve decided to move forward with another commitment that I had already signed before receiving the interview. This was not an easy choice at all, and I want to emphasize how much I appreciated the opportunity and how strongly I felt about the team and the research direction. \n\nIf there are any opportunities in the fall or spring, I would be extremely interested in staying in touch and would be thrilled to explore the possibility of interning with Microsoft then.\n\nThank you again for your understanding. I hope you guys have a wonderful summer! I truly hope our paths cross again soon.\n\nBest regards,\u2028Jenny\n",
