    "id": "8e4b6955-cfda-4212-8faa-ee583faa4a74",
    "title": "2025 travel highlight recap",
    "body": "My fav AESTHETIC pics from this year!! (Plus some from last year)\n\nTravel log !! \n(Jan) big island, Hawaii for conference\n(Feb) back to ny! \n(April - may) HUUUGE asia trip.. japan yokohama for conference, and took day trips  Kamakura, Fujikiwajizio\nThen I just went to Tokyo -> kyoto -> nara -> osaka with my sister and tao\nThen me and my sister went back to motherland and went shanghai for 2 day layover and saw uncle, and finally went to shenzhen (and Zhu hai and Zhong san) to visit my extended family.. swore id go back for longer next time :) \n(June) SF explorations and bay explorations!! (Lowkey suffered post travel depression) But I was home for the summer! \n(June) SD with hs friends \n(June) mammoth lakes + Yosemite couples road trip\n(July) American river + Tahoe for July 4!!\n(August) Seattle real quick for nikos google thing lol\n(August) Athens and milos!!\n(November) boston real quick for a break + home for thanksgiving \n(December) home for Christmas then Taiwan for new years!\n\nBig island \nNyc, ny\nSf\n2 Bay Area( Napa, Sausalito, Carmel by the sea)\n3 Y\nShanghai\n2 Shenzhen (Zhu hai Zhong san)\nSeoul \nMammoth lakes\nYosemite, American river, Tahoe\nSD\nSeattle, Boston \nAthens\n2 Milos \nTaiwan \n\nJan \n- Went to Hawaii for conference and I fuckin love the beach \n- Chilled in bay and went back to nyc \n\nFeb \n- Color factory in nyc (lowkey scam but whatever)\n- First flowers ever lol \n- I love going to flushing and need to go more this yr\n\nMarch \n- Made first poster \n- Won the c as in Charlie thing bc I drew one piece and got a bottle of wine and im the GOAT\n- Went home for spring break and found my grandpas research paper from Germany on google and he was happy \n\nApril\n- Greek easter! \n- Went to yokohoma for CHI! Gave first presentation \n- Also took day trips to mt fuji and Kamakura\u2026 second time in Japan I felt less like a tourist and paid attention to prices and when iw as getting scammed -_- \n\nMay\n- First animal cafe (and maid cafe -_-)\n- WAGYU WAGYU WAGYU !!\n- Kyoto -> nara -> osaka.. nara was so cool\n- Shanghai -> Shehnzhen (Zhu hai, zhongshan.)\n- Hangout with grandpa :) and asked him alot abt the past \n- Seoul \n- Graduation w vahab \n- Reunited with nikos and went to Carmel by the sea! + he met my fam \n\nJune\n- Explored SF much more this month! Had the best butter chicken of my life \n- Mammoth lakes and yosemite road trip!\n- Went to SD with hs friends.. I want to settle down there I can see it\n- Started editing vlogs as documentation hobby ! \n- Began my huge fuckin matcha drink making phase \n\nJuly \n- Tahoe and American river rafting w siblings + friends!\n- I want to ideate research from scratch lol \n- Surfing in SC and living out of Stanford \n- Started my substack like ive always wanted for funny essays (but the more recent ones have been too serious and I have vulnerability hangover) \n\nAugust \n- Met nikos fam in greece! Stayed in Athens and visited nafplio \n- Went to milos\u2026 literally the most gorgeous place ever I love greece and the islands and cant wait to explore more \n- Think I started rlly figuring out a makeup routine \n- Back to nyc for school\n\nSeptember\n- US open and met new friends (so appreciative <3) \n- Tryna figure out school again\n- Developed a self care routine and started hobbies like painting!\n\nOctober\n- Lotsa burnout :/ and doubted myself alot \n- Cooked more and went through a grandma phase (still lowkey in it)\n- Did a lot of painting in the city \n- were dorian and ionian greek columns for halloween lol \n\nNovember\n- Went to Boston!!\n- Surprise bday for nikos <3 + our anniversary!\n- Went some for thanksgiving and rode zooks and was near a shooting lol.. recovered from burn out a bit\n- Tried to spend more time alone \n- Established some double date buds \n\nDecember\n- Wrapped up work for the year and lots of things came full circle\n- Realized (again) how I should be trusting myself.. reflecting on the year and feeling grateful overall @ my growth\n- Relearned \u201cthe lark\u201d\n- Cooked food\n- Taiwan for new years~\n\nTalk to strangers\nBe more friendly without being salty even if I feel super uncomfortable because I thin someone dislikes me\u2026 don\u2019t overgive tho \nSlow down with what I want and dont want and dont jump to extremes\nTrust nikos wants the best for us more instead of freaking out. Be less codependent and more mindful of my internal experience \n",
